  note         = {Public GitHub repository providing the manuscript sources and the official open-source reference implementation of the Unified Variational Intelligence Framework (UVIF). The repository includes explicit implementations of the five variational forces and of the Variational Equilibrium policy search, the disjoint calibration--evaluation protocol, the fixed-weight scalarisation and monotone-penalty comparators used to test the discriminating predictions H1--H4, the single-force ablation and deployment analyses, the sensitivity sweep over all model constants, together with the executed simulation notebook, the generated figures, result tables and run logs, and all supporting artifacts required to reproduce the results reported in the accompanying paper.}
}

